ed like:\n```sql\nSELECT * FROM (\n  SELECT * FROM A\n  UNION ALL\n  SELECT * FROM B\n) AS D\nJOIN C ON D.id = C.id;\n```\n\nIt should be transformed into:\n```sql\nSELECT * FROM A\nJOIN C ON A.id = C.id\nUNION ALL\nSELECT * FROM B\nJOIN C ON B.id = C.id;\n```\n\n### Rule SEMI_JOIN_FILTER_TRANSPOSE:\n**Conditions**: This rule applies when a SQL query involves a semi-join (for example, using `IN`, `EXISTS`, or a join with a distinct condition to emulate a semi-", 'time': 24.25898241996765}
